talk about socializing or when you are socializing. Phrasal verbs are informal verbs so they fit well into conversations about and in social situations.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you add a particle (preposition) to a verb, it becomes a phrasal verb. The verb changes and has a different meaning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Phrasal Verb Form: <br/>verb + particle (preposition) <br/> <span class=\"italic\">set</span>  +  <span class=\"italic\">up</span>  =  arrange <br/> <span class=\"italic\">get</span>    + <span class=\"italic\">past</span>    =  overcome", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Phrasal verbs can be followed by phrases explaining \u2018what?' to give further explanation, but this is not always necessary.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">He's taking someone out? </span>(no explanation needed) <br/><span class=\"italic\">Let's set up a weekly lunch. </span>(more explanation needed)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have you caught up with Peter lately?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I helped him set up a profile.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He's into online dating now.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When he called up and asked what someone should do if they lost their date at a concert?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Being nervous going out on a first date always brings out the geek in Peter.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If he could just get past that awkward \u2018getting to know you' period.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Remember when he took his date out to the comic book store?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">wish</span> and the second conditional to talk about imaginary situations in the present or future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Form:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Wish  +     past form of verb<br/><span class=\"italic\">I wish</span> +  <span class=\"italic\">I were</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\"> I wish </span>+  <span class=\"italic\">he had </span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I wish</span> + <span class=\"italic\">they could</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If + Simple Past tense ,  modal (<span class=\"italic\">would</span> / <span class=\"italic\">could</span> / <span class=\"italic\">might</span>)<br/><span class=\"italic\">If I had ... , I would ...</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">If I knew ... , I could ...</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Wishes and sentences in the second conditional infer that what you want is probably not possible, or for some reason impossible.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Sentence</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span></div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish he could meet someone who appreciated him.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"people don't appreciate him\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He asked what someone should do if they lost their date.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he lost his date\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If he could get to know someone a little before he met them, it would help.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"he can't get to know them before they meet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I saw him more often.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't see him often\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to catch up with", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to exchange information about your personal lives", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I haven't caught up with Peter in weeks!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about friends and their relationships.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to repel", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The geek in Peter puts some women off.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be into", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be interested in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Are you into comic books?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "according to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "as stated by someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: According to Peter, this is a great film.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to appreciate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to understand the value of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wish he could find some who appreciated him!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "unimpressed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling no respect or interest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was soooo unimpressed with the comic book store!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to get past", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move forward away from something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If he could just get past the awkward first date!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le13ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write a story about a social situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use phrasal verbs to make it informal.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use familiar places and social situations in my story.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my story about someone in a social situation.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write 100 words explaining what someone did in a social situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Identify some phrasal verbs, familiar places and social situations that will help you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Add opinions where it is appropriate.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Keep the story light.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the story to someone.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le13ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob06re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Have you caught up with Peter lately? I wish I saw him more often.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I helped him set up  a profile. He's into online dating now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no! What do you think about that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: In my opinion, it's a waste of time.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm not so sure about that. If he could get to know someone a little before he met them, it would help.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I see what you mean. Being nervous going out on a first date always brings out the geek in Peter."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "28500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That's for sure. Remember when he took his date out to the comic book store? She was soooo unimpressed! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, and when he called up to ask what someone should do if they lost their date at a concert?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wish he could meet someone who appreciated him. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If he could just get past that awkward 'getting to know you' period, he'd be fine."}, {"image": "engenn7le13ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "52000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, according to Tender, if you're looking for love, there's someone for you!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sure that's true. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If we could just figure out how get him to bring his next date to your restaurant, maybe we could help! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Ooooo! Project Peter! Fun!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le13ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le13ob06re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can exchange opinions.", "ty